{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/rachel-nocode/Origin/pull/3","repo":"rachel-nocode/Origin","number":3,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Silk Knot — tactile thread motion toy","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Silk Knot\n\nA browser motion toy: draw a silk thread on warm linen paper, watch it settle into springy loops, then pluck segments like a harp string. Each pluck sends a gentle dye ripple (ochre, rose, sage) through the knot.\n\n**No score. No missions.** Just draw, pluck, watch.\n\n### Art direction\n\nPivoted away from neon/cyberpunk aesthetics per Rachel's feedback. Matte waxed-cotton thread on warm paper — tactile, editorial, human-feeling. No glow, no purple/cyan on black.\n\n### Run\n\n```bash\ncd demos/silk-knot\nbun install\nbun run dev\n```\n\n### Also in this PR\n\n- `AGENTS.md` — added hard rule against AI-slop neon UI; prefer tactile art direction\n\n### Demo\n\n![Silk Knot on warm paper](https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-d5bb0baf-694a-4c70-b11d-07df34bba7c5)\n\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e9324ea7-742b-52ad-9727-d0110550cae0/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Fsilk_knot_motion_demo.mp4\"><img src=\"https://cursor.com/artifacts/c/art-c1cc74b8-0f69-478b-898f-e1a33142d51b\" alt=\"silk_knot_motion_demo.mp4\" /></a>\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e9324ea7-742b-52ad-9727-d0110550cae0?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-e9324ea7-742b-52ad-9727-d0110550cae0&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source media=\"(p